            "review_title": "Review at Bien Hai Quan",
            "review_text": "TravelingFoodie\nMiami, Florida10754 contributions\n0\nGood food at great prices\nDec 2024 • Friends\nOur driver took us to a beachfront restaurant favored by locals. Despite its large, rundown appearance and modest 3.7 rating, don’t be deceived. The establishment offers a commendable selection of live seafood, all prepared skillfully. We particularly enjoyed the sea snails, blue crab, large shrimp, and grouper. I also tried some sizable, unfamiliar clams; while tasty, they were a bit too chewy for my liking. Overall, the restaurant provides good food at excellent prices with prompt service. By the way, if you sit facing the beach, you can see Cambodia as it is only 3-4km from the restaurant.\nRead more\nWritten January 9, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-10",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
