            "review_text": "Marianna B\nMoscow, Russia125 contributions\n0\nBest seafood experience in Phuquoc\nJan 2024 • Family\nA great place to taste all the genuine flavours of Vietnamese food, including fresh seafood which they catch right here (from shrimps, scallops, squid, fish and much more)- you can see the fisherman boats catching fresh seafood. The restaurant is located right on the beach so you can enjoy the most beautiful sunset if you come before 6pm.\n\nThe stuff is super friendly and great. They make fresh juice from big variety of fruits here, and they serve alcohol if wanted.\nRead more\nWritten January 7, 2024",
