            "review_text": "Jessica G\nMelbourne, Australia26 contributions\n0\nYUCK! Don’t go here!\nAug 2023 • Family\nDo NOT eat here! The food is pretty yuck but high price for Vietnam. The service is non-existent. They are rude, don’t even smile at customers. Everything was dirty, smelly & ugly. I’m all for an authentic Vietnamese restaurant, I don’t mind sitting on a plastic chair slurping phò on the side of the road…. But this place was just plain gross. And now i hear that taxi driver takes 30% of our bill if he takes us here. Dodgy AF. Don’t do it!\nRead more\nWritten August 28, 2023",
